message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
title: "BB-5KBC: archaeological sites in Brandenburg, East Germany and West Poland around 5000 BC"
abstract: >-
  Linked Open Data representation of some 540 archaeological sites with dating,
  cultural attribution, discovery events and georeferencing, aligned with CIDOC
  CRM and prepared for loading into the NFDI4Objects Knowledge Graph.
